WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.007
Pin the Place is a geography game on a world map. One to ten players, and you can play it alone.

2
00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:18.873
A place is named at the top, and everybody guesses at the same time. Drag to pan the map, pinch or scroll to zoom, and tap to drop your pin. Tap again to move it.

3
00:00:19.023 --> 00:00:20.777
When you're happy, lock it in.

4
00:00:21.477 --> 00:00:31.370
Once everyone's done, or the time runs out, the answer is revealed. The closer you are, the more points you earn. A perfect pin is worth five thousand.

5
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:38.743
If you're stuck, a clue appears after a third of the time, showing the continent. After two thirds, the country's flag.

6
00:00:39.443 --> 00:00:46.057
Zoom in before you drop your pin. A few kilometres can be the difference between a good round and a great one.
